  "description": "1. Flux Klein 9b txt2img is a text to image workflow designed to turn a text prompt into a finished still image using FLUX.2 Klein 9B. Its 14-node graph exposes 1 prompt/text field(s), 0 media input target(s), and 1 save/preview stage(s), while preserving the original editor-format graph for reference. The ComfyUI editor graph was converted to API format and is ready for live validation against the connected node and model registry.",
